122
00:04:29.323 --> 00:04:31.660
(sighing deeply) This really strikes a chord.

123
00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.791
Yeah.

124
00:04:32.791 --> 00:04:33.624
(audience applauding)

125
00:04:33.624 --> 00:04:35.020
It really does.

126
00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.290
I just found this whole project fascinating.

127
00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.390
I can't recommend it enough.

128
00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:39.360
On Amazon right now.

129
00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.254
Good job, Amy.

130
00:04:40.254 --> 00:04:43.171 line:15%
